740deee5b75e0897ba98765cce7c9bc8f2b156db721d0dd618a5fed1a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-40450" :question/id #uuid "4d6d3f76-538d-50cd-8960-d1a5eec76f1e" :question/math-academy-id "q-40450" :question/problem "Find the standard matrix that  represents  the  linear  transformation $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{2},$ where\n$T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-3x-5y+2z \\\\ 2x-3y\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "We require a $2\\times 3$ matrix $T$ such that\n    \n\n$$\nT\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}(-3)x+(-5)y+2z \\\\ 2x+(-3)y+0z\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that\n    \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3x-5y+2z \\\\ 2x-3y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix which represents the linear transformation $T$ is\n    \n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & -5 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-40450/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0e35b58a-530f-5b9b-8df2-eb737f8af581"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-40450"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-8052"] :question/problem "Find the standard matrix that  represents  the  linear  transformation $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{2},$ where\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}x-3y+8z \\\\ x+z+2y\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We require a $2\\times 3$ matrix $T$ such that\n\n$$\nT\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1x+(-3)y+8z \\\\ 1x+2y+1z\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}x-3y+8z \\\\ x+z+2y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix which represents the linear transformation $T$ is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "3b0b1b0e-89aa-552f-a8e2-f9cceb41c2df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "b457de58-39aa-59ec-9b74-1e81c0839a85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "16beee57-367a-587c-aa6e-8c7c4b8f8e0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "44bc2da5-dfa4-56a3-8b35-df95bfd3039c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "d9eff58d-ad69-51fe-bbd5-ca5e49e2de64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ce4027a9-bb6c-5df9-bc01-483204187e3f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-96977/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-96977/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-96977/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-96977/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-96977/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-96977/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-96977" :question/id #uuid "8c6270f1-c931-577a-acb9-786cb0edb420" :question/math-academy-id "q-96977" :question/problem "$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}],\\,T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}ay+3z-x \\\\ bz-2x+cy\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the standard matrix $T$ of the linear transformation $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{2}$ shown above. What is the value of $a+b+c?$" :question/worked-solution "Given the vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-x+0y+3z \\\\ -2x+4y+2z\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0y+3z-x \\\\ 2z-2x+4y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}0y+3z-x \\\\ 2z-2x+4y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a+b+c=0+2+4=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-96977/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f63a7522-8d05-5d3a-aafb-3450292f910f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-96977"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-38271"] :question/problem "$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 4\\end{aligned}],\\,T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}ay+2x-2z \\\\ bz-3x+cy\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the standard matrix $T$ of the linear transformation $T:{R}^{3}\\to {R}^{2}$ shown above. What is the value of $a+b+c?$" :question/worked-solution "Given the vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2x-3y-2z \\\\ -3x-y+4z\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3y+2x-2z \\\\ 4z-3x-y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-3y+2x-2z \\\\ 4z-3x+(-1)y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a+b+c=4+(-3)+(-1)=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "751f0ab0-091c-5105-9343-764b504461e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "705bb233-0253-59bf-a5c2-fa2874395dee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "63d481f0-b30f-56f4-99e7-f5cec78dd844" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "d5e0cd58-e423-551b-91a5-891cfcc50dad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "4a2a502c-75a5-56c7-a6e0-218c1eb84c6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f53b953b-0e7f-5c57-83d2-d0e5010d5d34" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-140422/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-140422/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-140422/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-140422/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-140422/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" "q-140422/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-140422" :question/id #uuid "f6c6739f-0bc4-58a0-97c1-be61353fa33d" :question/math-academy-id "q-140422" :question/problem "$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\,\\,T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}5x+4y \\\\ 3y+bx \\\\ -6x+cy\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the standard matrix $T$ of the linear transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{3}$ shown above. What is the value of $c+b?$" :question/worked-solution "Given the vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\\\ -6 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}5x+4y \\\\ -x+3y \\\\ -6x+7y\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5x+4y \\\\ 3y-x \\\\ -6x+7y\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}5x+4y \\\\ 3y+(-1)x \\\\ -6x+(7)y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $c+b=(-1)+7=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-140422/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f63a7522-8d05-5d3a-aafb-3450292f910f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-140422"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-38272"] :question/problem "$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -8 \\\\ -9 & 7\\end{aligned}],\\,T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-3x+y \\\\ ax-8y \\\\ -9x+by\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the standard matrix $T$ of the linear transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{3}$ shown above. What is the value of $a+b?$" :question/worked-solution "Given the vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -8 \\\\ -9 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-3x+y \\\\ -2x-8y \\\\ -9x+7y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}-3x+y \\\\ -2x-8y \\\\ -9x+7y\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a+b=-2+7=5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "a72f54b7-2200-57ee-9300-eb15273a9d4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "8756188c-cd7a-5fff-b57c-69232df56a93" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "606386a3-b928-50ae-9f6a-8186f69d0204" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "b36f49dc-23a5-5431-b4b6-35363fd4e18b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "8b05e5cb-46c0-5682-b62f-1318e2f79ac8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-96974/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "da01e219-7d03-53db-8f59-92023ac2d8ef" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/